- Unit economics by successful workflow, not only by token

A concrete monthly estimate requires traffic, tokens, regions, retention, SLA and provider price assumptions; any estimate without these would be unreliable.

## 15.8 Disaster recovery

- Automated database PITR
- Cross-region encrypted backups
- Object replication
- Infrastructure reproducible from Terraform
- Configuration and policy backups
- Runbook-driven regional failover
- Quarterly restore tests
- Annual full regional evacuation exercise
- Customer-visible recovery status

